{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00259","headline":"石淙 · 则天皇后","name":"石淙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三山十洞光玄籙，玉峤金峦镇紫微。\n均露均霜标胜壤，交风交雨列皇畿。\n万仞高岩藏日色，千寻幽涧浴云衣。\n且驻欢筵赏仁智，琱鞍薄晚杂尘飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}